WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.046 --> 00:00:05.797
Somebody help me, please!

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:07.341
Anybody!

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.635
What happened?

00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:12.763
I had a heart attack.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.973
I had to get a transplant.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.935
Does it feel any different?

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:22.439
Can you tell
it's someone else's?

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:28.862
I just want everything to go
back to the way it was before.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.281
It's just so weird

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.409
that someone had to die
in order for me to live.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:37.579
How are you, Frank?

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:38.830
Thank you, both.

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:41.500
Your daughter,
she saved Sasha's life.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.293
I can't even begin imagining

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.670
what you have gone through.

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:45.837
I just want you to know

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:47.506
we're gonna do
everything we can

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:48.840
to keep her memory alive.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.634
Nancy and I have endowed

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.177
a scholarship
in Becky's name.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.555
We want to offer
the scholarship to Sasha.

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:56.848
Watch out for that family.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:01.353
I want to know
who's inside of me.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:03.647
I'm seeing things.
Things that she saw.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:17.619
What the hell?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.501
This is getting weird.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:35.971
I think one day,
we're gonna realize

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:38.015
that this whole
heart attack thing

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.891
was the best thing
that happened to you.

